    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731010/extras/0ca5cf53cc6f6cc9f2d816fc121150b0.avif?t=1752744379\" width=600 height=1756 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<strong>The Traveller Vanilla Version</strong>&quot; is a choice driven high quality Visual Novel/Game with plenty of adventures. Please note that this game is a non-adult version of <strong>&quot;The Traveller&quot;</strong> and doesn't have any adult scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Traveller (it's his code name and yes, he is half British), a mysterious young man with many talents and a good sense of humor visits various places and completes certain tasks for a secret organization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He is young, spirited and full of energy. The Traveller has a strong sense of justice and is always ready to help people out of trouble, especially beautiful girls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game you need to accomplish your mission in a city and if you play it right, you can make friends with some hot local girls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>What's included:</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Three assignments to complete</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 10 girls you can meet (ranging from waitresses to FBI agents and celebrities)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 20+ different locations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 18 characters in total</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiple choices</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Good humor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Bonus video for the winner</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Walkthrough (in case you're lost)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you value high quality realistic 3D art and an interesting plot, this game is definitely for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2731010/extras/0ca5cf53cc6f6cc9f2d816fc121150b0.avif?t=1752744379\" width=600 height=1756 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<strong>The Traveller Vanilla Version</strong>&quot; is a choice driven high quality Visual Novel/Game with plenty of adventures. Please note that this game is a non-adult version of <strong>&quot;The Traveller&quot;</strong> and doesn't have any adult scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Traveller (it's his code name and yes, he is half British), a mysterious young man with many talents and a good sense of humor visits various places and completes certain tasks for a secret organization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He is young, spirited and full of energy. The Traveller has a strong sense of justice and is always ready to help people out of trouble, especially beautiful girls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game you need to accomplish your mission in a city and if you play it right, you can make friends with some hot local girls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>What's included:</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Three assignments to complete</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 10 girls you can meet (ranging from waitresses to FBI agents and celebrities)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 20+ different locations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 18 characters in total</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiple choices</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Good humor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Bonus video for the winner</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Walkthrough (in case you're lost)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you value high quality realistic 3D art and an interesting plot, this game is definitely for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
